      "Bash(git -C \"f:/opensource/usv_esp32/esp32s3rover/ardupilot_rover_esp32s3_idf\" commit -m \"$\\(cat <<''EOF''\nv1.6.0 - USV 功能精简\n\n### 已禁用的功能模块\n- AP_WHEELENCODER_ENABLED=0 \\(WENC\\) - 轮编码器\n- AP_WHEELRATECONTROL_ENABLED=0 \\(WRC\\) - 轮速率控制\n- AP_ROVER_CRASH_CHECK_ENABLED=0 \\(CRASH_ANGLE\\) - 翻车检测\n- AP_ROVER_BALANCEBOT_ENABLED=0 - 平衡车\n- HAL_MSP_ENABLED=0 - MSP协议\n- AP_BEACON_ENABLED=0 \\(BCN\\) - 室内信标\n- HAL_SPRAYER_ENABLED=0 \\(SPRAY\\) - 喷洒器\n- AC_PRECLAND_ENABLED=0 \\(PLND\\) - 精确着陆\n- MODE_DOCK_ENABLED=0 - 对接模式\n- AP_OPTICALFLOW_ENABLED=0 \\(FLOW\\) - 光流传感器\n- AP_AIRSPEED_ENABLED=0 - 空速计\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code]\\(https://claude.com/claude-code\\)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n\\)\")",
