      "Bash(git -C \"f:/opensource/usv_esp32/esp32s3rover/ardupilot_rover_esp32s3_idf\" commit -m \"$\\(cat <<''EOF''\nv2.1.0 - BNO08x ENU→NED 坐标转换修复 & I2C 自动恢复\n\n### 修复\n- ENU→NED 坐标转换: 改用欧拉角中间转换，修复航向偏差问题\n  - roll_ned = pitch_enu\n  - pitch_ned = roll_enu\n  - yaw_ned = π/2 - yaw_enu\n\n### 新增\n- I2C 连续失败计数和自动重新初始化 \\(50次失败后\\)\n- 每10秒输出统计日志 \\(pkts/err/rst/reinit\\)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code]\\(https://claude.com/claude-code\\)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n\\)\")",
      "Bash(git -C \"f:/opensource/usv_esp32/esp32s3rover/ardupilot_rover_esp32s3_idf\" tag -a v2.1.0 -m \"v2.1.0 - BNO08x ENU→NED 坐标转换修复 & I2C 自动恢复\")",
