      "Bash(\"D:\\\\\\\\Espressif\\\\\\\\tools\\\\\\\\tools\\\\\\\\xtensa-esp-elf\\\\\\\\esp-14.2.0_20241119\\\\\\\\xtensa-esp-elf\\\\\\\\bin\\\\\\\\xtensa-esp32s3-elf-addr2line.exe\":*)",
      "Bash(git -C \"f:/opensource/usv_esp32/esp32s3rover/ardupilot_rover_esp32s3_idf\" add CHANGELOG.md components/lora_mavlink/include/lora_mavlink.h components/lora_mavlink/src/lora_mavlink.c components/lora_mavlink/src/sx126x.c components/lora_mavlink/src/sx126x_hal_esp32.c libraries/AP_HAL_ESP32/Storage.cpp libraries/AP_HAL_ESP32/hwdef/esp32s3rover/hwdef.dat libraries/AP_HAL_ESP32/hwdef/hwdef.h main/main.c)",
      "Bash(git -C \"f:/opensource/usv_esp32/esp32s3rover/ardupilot_rover_esp32s3_idf\" commit -m \"$\\(cat <<''EOF''\nv2.2.0 - LoRa MAVLink 数传初步完成\n\n### LoRa SX1268 驱动集成\n- lora_mavlink 组件: 完整的 TX/RX 实现\n  - 环形缓冲区 \\(TX/RX ring buffer\\)\n  - FreeRTOS 任务调度\n  - DIO1 中断处理\n- sx126x 驱动配置 \\(EBYTE E22-400MBL 兼容\\):\n  - Sync Word: 0x1444, OCP: 0x38, TX Ramp: 40us\n  - 433MHz, SF11, BW500kHz, 22dBm\n\n### SERIAL3 虚拟串口启用\n- 架构: SERIAL3 → LoRaUARTDriver → lora_mavlink → sx126x → SPI → SX1268\n- HAL_UART_NUM_SERIAL_PORTS: 3 → 4\n- HAL_HAVE_SERIAL3_PARAMS: 0 → 1\n- DEFAULT_SERIAL3_PROTOCOL: SerialProtocol_MAVLink2\n\n### hwdef.dat LoRa 引脚修复\n- LORA_PIN_SCK: GPIO_NUM_39 → GPIO_NUM_40\n- LORA_PIN_MISO: GPIO_NUM_40 → GPIO_NUM_39\n\n### Storage 调试输出修复\n- 问题: STORAGEDEBUG 导致大量 printf，触发看门狗超时重启\n- 修复: 注释 #define STORAGEDEBUG 1\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code]\\(https://claude.com/claude-code\\)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n\\)\")",
      "Bash(git -C \"f:/opensource/usv_esp32/esp32s3rover/ardupilot_rover_esp32s3_idf\" tag -a v2.2.0 -m \"v2.2.0 - LoRa MAVLink 数传初步完成: SX1268驱动集成, SERIAL3虚拟串口启用, hwdef引脚修复, Storage调试修复\")",
